WEBVTT

00:41.917 --> 00:45.963
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

01:15.325 --> 01:17.119
Why do you stare at it so intently?

01:20.497 --> 01:23.750
Does a plum blossom flowering
in midsummer unsettle you so?

01:25.335 --> 01:27.129
No, it is not that.

01:35.095 --> 01:37.556
Flowers that bloom in season are no fun.

01:38.098 --> 01:40.851
I want nothing less that a plum blossom
amid midwinter snow

01:41.893 --> 01:43.562
if I am to see any charm in it.

01:44.146 --> 01:45.480
Did you hear?

01:45.564 --> 01:49.067
A marriage proposal was delivered
to Seonghyeon Pavilion this morning.

01:49.151 --> 01:51.069
I guess the prince is getting married.

01:58.076 --> 01:59.411
Dry this by the window.

02:01.204 --> 02:02.289
Yes, Your Highness.

02:18.764 --> 02:20.766
-It is raining.
-Leave it.

02:36.823 --> 02:38.784
Do you like the rain?

02:40.118 --> 02:42.037
Why? Do you dislike it?

02:42.120 --> 02:43.497
What is there to like?

02:44.081 --> 02:45.582
The mud gets everywhere,

02:45.666 --> 02:47.209
my skirt gets soaked,

02:48.085 --> 02:49.628
and the laundry piles up.

02:50.212 --> 02:52.923
I doubt any court lady likes the rain.

02:57.928 --> 02:59.054
Is that so?

03:06.937 --> 03:08.105
Your Highness!

03:19.199 --> 03:20.701
Please go back inside.

03:22.035 --> 03:24.121
You will catch a cold at this rate.

03:32.170 --> 03:33.171
Stay still.

03:39.344 --> 03:41.138
Now feel it for yourself.

03:41.722 --> 03:42.973
This cleansing chill.

04:04.202 --> 04:05.287
Gosh.

04:05.829 --> 04:08.582
A second cleanse might leave me bedridden.

04:09.416 --> 04:11.710
A little rain will not kill you.

04:15.088 --> 04:16.256
Then again,

04:17.215 --> 04:18.925
it must be different for a woman.

04:36.777 --> 04:38.403
Why are you just standing there?

04:39.237 --> 04:40.739
Hurry up and run.

04:43.241 --> 04:44.826
What do you think you're doing?

04:49.289 --> 04:51.583
Protecting you. I gave you my word.

04:52.959 --> 04:54.544
You sure this is protecting me?

04:55.462 --> 04:57.214
Or are we just going down together?

05:03.553 --> 05:04.805
It is fine

05:05.722 --> 05:07.390
if we are together.

05:09.309 --> 05:10.393
What

05:10.477 --> 05:12.103
are you doing?

05:15.690 --> 05:17.526
It really is shining.

05:19.986 --> 05:21.238
Now that I am with you.

05:42.300 --> 05:45.554
EPISODE 8
SCREW THIS WORLD

05:46.179 --> 05:48.139
-Look. They're coming out.
-There they are!

05:48.223 --> 05:49.850
-They're coming out!
-Over there!

05:51.977 --> 05:52.894
Listen here!

05:52.978 --> 05:54.855
I shall explain everything.

05:54.938 --> 05:56.064
-That woman…
-Shin Seo-ri.

05:56.147 --> 05:57.482
-Isn't she that model?
-That model.

05:57.566 --> 05:58.525
That is right!

05:58.608 --> 06:00.402
I am the one from the rumors.

06:00.485 --> 06:01.611
I am Shin Seo-ri.

06:02.404 --> 06:03.738
Are you insane?

06:03.822 --> 06:05.532
Mr. Cha Se-gye here

06:05.615 --> 06:07.659
is the chief of my agency.

06:07.742 --> 06:08.827
First, I can say

06:08.910 --> 06:11.204
Mr. Cha did not touch
a drop of alcohol that night.

06:11.288 --> 06:13.373
I swear that on my life.

06:13.456 --> 06:14.499
That night,

06:14.583 --> 06:16.793
he just accompanied me
in a management capacity.

06:16.877 --> 06:18.169
I would like to deeply apologize

06:19.296 --> 06:20.630
for causing this misunderstanding.

06:20.714 --> 06:22.674
Misunderstanding?
Are you denying the scandal?

06:22.757 --> 06:25.510
Then why did you two go
to the beach alone at night?

06:25.594 --> 06:28.013
We only returned to the set
in the dead of night…

06:31.016 --> 06:31.933
for this beach stone.

06:32.017 --> 06:33.727
-A beach stone?
-What is that?

06:34.352 --> 06:36.933
A beach stone? Isn't that just a rock?

06:37.022 --> 06:39.733
Under the guidance of Mr. Cha,
who was worried about the fine

06:39.816 --> 06:41.735
we could have incurred
due to their removal,

06:41.818 --> 06:43.682
we returned the stones
to their rightful place.

06:43.782 --> 06:45.032
But I was severely intoxicated,

06:45.113 --> 06:46.781
and I managed to forget this one.

06:47.407 --> 06:49.993
I vow to return
this beach stone promptly as well.

06:50.619 --> 06:51.953
And to clear the air,

06:52.037 --> 06:54.289
I wish to now bring to light the good deed

06:54.372 --> 06:56.041
Mr. Cha had wished to keep quiet.

06:58.627 --> 07:00.128
Good deed? What good deed?

07:00.670 --> 07:01.963
Mr. Cha Se-gye

07:02.047 --> 07:05.258
will donate half of the profits
from this commercial shoot

07:05.342 --> 07:07.677
to the conservation
of Tamna Island's natural heritage.

07:07.761 --> 07:09.387
Nothing short of magnanimous.

07:09.930 --> 07:10.931
I will?

07:11.014 --> 07:12.515
Wow.

07:17.103 --> 07:17.979
Yes.

07:18.563 --> 07:21.733
As Biojei is a company
with eco-friendliness as its core slogan,

07:21.816 --> 07:24.277
we plan to lead the way
on eco-friendly policy.

07:24.361 --> 07:25.487
"Eco-friendly"?

07:26.988 --> 07:29.324
That is also why we chose Jeju
and its pristine nature

07:29.407 --> 07:30.575
as the backdrop

07:30.659 --> 07:33.370
for the ad campaign
of our newly launched Dynaestie line.

07:34.204 --> 07:35.747
Look at them perfectly in sync.

07:35.830 --> 07:37.540
And there is one more important fact.

07:37.624 --> 07:40.293
I already have a beloved.

07:40.377 --> 07:41.962
-What?
-All of a sudden?

07:42.045 --> 07:43.546
He possesses a face as fine as jade

07:43.630 --> 07:45.882
and a character as noble as a crane.

07:45.966 --> 07:47.592
Therefore, we ask that you all refrain

07:47.676 --> 07:50.553
from engaging in speculation and rumors
regarding this matter.

07:50.637 --> 07:51.972
Now, please excuse me.

07:52.055 --> 07:53.098
Until next time.

07:53.181 --> 07:55.058
-Ms. Shin!
-Wait, Ms. Shin!

07:59.270 --> 08:00.730
Now then. A further detailed statement

08:00.814 --> 08:03.483
will be delivered through our PR team.

08:03.566 --> 08:05.110
POWER-TRIPPING CEO'S SUDDEN PIVOT?

08:05.193 --> 08:06.736
CAN THIS DONATION SAVE HIM NOW?

08:07.278 --> 08:09.155
…ACQUIRES ENTERTAINMENT AGENCY
IN QUESTIONABLE MOVE

08:09.239 --> 08:10.865
UNKNOWN ACTRESS
DECLARES SHE HAS A LOVER

08:10.949 --> 08:12.367
UNWANTED CONFESSION
SPARKS CONTROVERSY

08:17.622 --> 08:18.790
Have you lost your damn mind?

08:18.873 --> 08:20.829
Are you trying to blow yourself up?

08:21.167 --> 08:22.252
Dimwits.

08:22.335 --> 08:24.212
It appears the stratagem worked.

08:24.921 --> 08:27.590
-What stratagem?
-The 35th Stratagem: The Chain Stratagem.

08:27.674 --> 08:30.552
First, I used the Beauty Trap
to distract the enemy's gaze.

08:30.635 --> 08:32.762
Then, the Self-Injury to reverse our odds.

08:32.846 --> 08:35.724
I chained these stratagems together
to buy us time.

08:36.349 --> 08:38.309
And now we seize
this opening to plot our reversal.

08:38.393 --> 08:39.894
Stratagems, my ass.

08:39.978 --> 08:40.895
And the donation?

08:40.979 --> 08:43.523
Half the profits? Do you have
any idea how much that actually is?

08:43.606 --> 08:45.191
Do I need to know?

08:45.275 --> 08:47.235
The rich are always the ones
most obsessed with money.

08:47.318 --> 08:49.946
Everyone's already watching
to see when I'll fail.

08:50.030 --> 08:52.866
Whether I donate or not,
whether the agency tanks or not.

08:52.949 --> 08:54.868
Now they're going
to scrutinize all of that too.

08:54.951 --> 08:56.244
That is just your imagination.

08:56.327 --> 08:58.621
You really think the whole world
revolves around you.

08:58.705 --> 09:00.040
That is enough idle chatter.

09:00.123 --> 09:01.791
Let us go get a bite to eat now.

09:04.419 --> 09:06.337
I'm about to be robbed
of my hard-earned money.

09:06.421 --> 09:07.922
You think I have an appetite?

09:13.928 --> 09:14.971
You are eating just fine.

09:15.055 --> 09:17.348
You can't enjoy anything
on an empty stomach.

09:20.435 --> 09:21.478
So what now?

09:22.062 --> 09:23.772
I would've just handled it all on my own.

09:23.855 --> 09:26.107
Why did you have to butt in
and complicate everything?

09:26.191 --> 09:27.525
Was I supposed to do nothing?

09:27.609 --> 09:30.612
You were about to be
unjustly torn apart by a pack of wolves.

09:31.237 --> 09:32.864
I came all this way to save you.

09:34.324 --> 09:35.241
Save me?

09:39.204 --> 09:41.247
I really thought
some grand declaration was coming.

09:41.331 --> 09:43.166
I almost had a heart attack.

09:43.249 --> 09:45.043
Were you expecting, "I am his woman"?

09:45.126 --> 09:47.045
Were you terrified
I would publicly announce that?

09:47.128 --> 09:48.421
Of course I was terrified.

09:48.505 --> 09:50.882
Afraid you'd get dragged
through the mud with me.

09:51.716 --> 09:52.675
It scared me.

09:57.722 --> 09:59.140
I have a brain, you know.

09:59.224 --> 10:00.600
I would not be so reckless.

10:01.184 --> 10:03.103
I am done being "someone's woman."

10:03.645 --> 10:06.022
I want no part of such a label.

10:06.106 --> 10:07.107
Label?

10:08.274 --> 10:09.901
Dan-sim of the Kang clan.

10:09.984 --> 10:11.236
How did such a precious treasure

10:11.319 --> 10:13.029
end up in your possession?

10:13.113 --> 10:14.572
That is…

10:14.656 --> 10:16.157
a personal possession.

10:16.241 --> 10:19.244
This jade is so prized that it is offered
as imperial tribute even in Qing.

10:19.327 --> 10:21.121
How dare you lie to me!

10:21.204 --> 10:22.622
Hear me!

10:22.705 --> 10:25.375
-Drag her out and flog her!
-Yes, ma'am.

10:25.458 --> 10:27.794
Ma'am, may I have a moment?

10:33.967 --> 10:35.468
You just need to say one thing.

10:35.552 --> 10:38.263
If you do, I shall provide you
with a means to survive.

10:39.055 --> 10:41.307
Declare that you lay
with the Grand Prince.

10:51.568 --> 10:53.361
Your silence says it all.

10:53.444 --> 10:56.239
You have already given him
your heart. Foolish girl.

10:56.322 --> 10:59.450
Do you believe you are the only one
who has caught his eye?

10:59.534 --> 11:01.244
This palace is rife

11:01.327 --> 11:03.121
with lonely court ladies such as yourself.

11:03.204 --> 11:05.415
Whispering honeyed words
is effortless for a man.

11:05.498 --> 11:07.917
That cannot be true.
His Highness would not--

11:08.001 --> 11:09.085
It is clear

11:09.752 --> 11:11.337
you have yet to come to your senses.

11:11.421 --> 11:14.174
As long as the Grand Prince
remains out of his brother's favor,

11:14.257 --> 11:15.425
he will not survive.

11:16.134 --> 11:17.427
So make your choice.

11:17.510 --> 11:20.388
Die as the Grand Prince's beloved,

11:20.471 --> 11:23.474
or live as a witness to his treason.

11:23.558 --> 11:25.018
A choice?

11:25.560 --> 11:27.604
Was a mere court lady

11:27.687 --> 11:30.398
ever afforded the right to choose?

11:31.232 --> 11:34.402
Even if I stand at the crossroads
of life and death again,

11:34.485 --> 11:37.447
I will never cower behind a man.

11:40.408 --> 11:42.160
Are you making a proclamation now?

11:42.243 --> 11:44.787
Must we be this solemn at a stew place?

11:44.871 --> 11:46.748
I am just telling you where I stand.

11:46.831 --> 11:48.166
So bear that in mind.

11:48.249 --> 11:50.501
I will stand tall
on my own two feet in this life,

11:50.585 --> 11:51.461
without fail.

11:52.003 --> 11:53.880
Save the chatter and just support me.

11:58.426 --> 11:59.510
I'm sometimes

11:59.594 --> 12:01.638
overwhelmed by your sheer audacity.

12:03.181 --> 12:05.099
How commendable you are, Shin Seo-ri.

12:05.600 --> 12:06.643
I most certainly am.

12:07.227 --> 12:10.188
Tenacity like mine would even reduce
the Jade Emperor to tears.

12:14.692 --> 12:16.778
I'll take care of it all, so don't worry.

12:17.779 --> 12:20.615
What exactly is he taking care of?

12:26.287 --> 12:27.247
Grandfather.

12:27.956 --> 12:30.458
Goodness.
What brings you here at this hour?

12:35.046 --> 12:37.465
It seemed like
Se-gye was struggling a bit.

12:37.548 --> 12:40.051
May I step in, Grandfather?

12:42.929 --> 12:44.013
Take care.

12:44.806 --> 12:46.474
Why did you pay for that?

12:46.557 --> 12:50.436
I am a man with no history
of ever accepting a meal from a woman.

12:50.520 --> 12:52.188
And it had to be you, of all people.

12:52.272 --> 12:53.314
This doesn't count.

12:53.398 --> 12:54.440
It's not a real date.

12:54.524 --> 12:56.818
Did you expect me
to just continue freeloading?

12:56.901 --> 12:58.236
Freeloaders go bald.

12:58.319 --> 13:00.905
Someone's awfully scared of hair loss.
Women don't go bald.

13:00.989 --> 13:02.198
That is not true.

13:02.282 --> 13:04.951
Between endocrine disruptors
and microplastics,

13:05.034 --> 13:07.370
women are not immune to hair loss either.

13:07.453 --> 13:08.955
You've been quite the scholar tonight.

13:09.038 --> 13:10.123
Been hitting the books?

13:10.206 --> 13:12.792
Fearing I had become a dopamine addict,

13:12.875 --> 13:14.585
I traded Shorts for the newspaper.

13:15.753 --> 13:17.297
That's music to my ears.

13:17.380 --> 13:19.632
It seems your English has improved too.

13:19.716 --> 13:20.883
That…

13:21.718 --> 13:23.094
still remains out of reach.

13:23.803 --> 13:26.389
Speaking a different tongue
is harder than it looks.

13:29.475 --> 13:30.977
You still have a long way to go.

13:31.060 --> 13:33.980
English is a must if you want to be
a global superstar. What's your plan?

13:34.063 --> 13:36.232
If you're so worried, teach me yourself.

13:36.316 --> 13:38.401
I don't really have the time
to be a private tutor.

13:38.484 --> 13:39.444
But what can I do?

13:39.527 --> 13:40.945
What's the hourly rate?

13:41.029 --> 13:42.363
You are going to charge me?

13:42.447 --> 13:44.240
Of course. Who are you trying to swindle?

13:44.324 --> 13:46.659
-Nothing in life is free.
-I am no swindler!

13:50.204 --> 13:51.122
Get in.

13:57.962 --> 13:59.422
Sir, we have a big problem.

14:00.965 --> 14:02.008
CHIEF OF STAFF SON JAE-HAN

14:04.260 --> 14:07.430
CHAIL'S CHA SE-GYE
MOCHANG'S MO TAE-HEE CONFIRM RELATIONSHIP

14:11.768 --> 14:15.271
The relationship between the heirs
of Chail and Mochang

14:15.355 --> 14:17.231
is drawing immense public attention.

14:17.315 --> 14:19.734
Insiders say Cha Se-gye,
the head of a cosmetics startup,

14:19.817 --> 14:23.279
and Mo Tae-hee,
the head of a jewelry brand,

14:23.363 --> 14:25.698
have recently begun
seeing each other quietly

14:25.782 --> 14:28.451
and are expected to tie the knot soon--

14:29.911 --> 14:33.247
Our chairman appears to be
in quite a hurry.

14:33.331 --> 14:35.333
GRANDFATHER

14:41.339 --> 14:42.256
Hey.

14:43.841 --> 14:44.967
Why the long face?

14:45.968 --> 14:47.428
Why? Is someone cursing you out?

14:47.512 --> 14:49.514
Leaving malicious comments?
Should I reply for you?

14:49.597 --> 14:51.557
Stop it. I thought you were
on a dopamine detox.

14:51.641 --> 14:53.059
-I'm confiscating this.
-Give it back!

14:53.142 --> 14:56.270
Late-night scrolling
will rot your brain, you know.

14:56.354 --> 14:57.230
Hey.

14:57.939 --> 14:58.856
Just forget it.

14:58.940 --> 15:01.317
Let's turn off our phones
and focus on reality.

15:03.486 --> 15:04.987
How about ramyeon for round two?

15:05.071 --> 15:06.155
Ramyeon?

15:10.910 --> 15:14.414
A man and a woman having ramyeon
at this late hour.

15:14.497 --> 15:15.665
That can only mean…

15:19.752 --> 15:22.794
I am full as it is.
Why would we eat ramyeon?

15:22.880 --> 15:25.216
I'm suggesting it
because it's not just any ramyeon.

15:25.299 --> 15:27.677
-I wonder if they're open 24 hours.
-"24 hours"?

15:28.344 --> 15:30.041
You want to stay up all night…

15:30.596 --> 15:31.514
Gosh.

15:37.687 --> 15:39.021
OPEN 24 HOURS

15:39.105 --> 15:40.356
24 HOURS, OPEN 24 HOURS

15:40.440 --> 15:42.608
OPEN 24/7

15:45.695 --> 15:47.572
I am not ready for this step yet!

15:48.072 --> 15:49.574
Stop the car and give me my phone.

15:49.657 --> 15:51.033
What? Why do you want your phone?

15:51.117 --> 15:52.285
What do you mean, why?

15:52.368 --> 15:54.036
It is mine, so return it!

15:54.120 --> 15:55.079
Hold on.

15:55.163 --> 15:56.747
Jeez! Watch your hands!

15:56.831 --> 15:58.082
This is extortion!

15:58.166 --> 16:00.751
Kidnapping or extortion.
Think whatever you want--

16:00.835 --> 16:02.462
Hand it over! My phone!

16:03.796 --> 16:04.922
The ramyeon you mentioned…

16:05.006 --> 16:07.258
Not just any ramyeon.
It's ramyeon by the Hangang River.

16:07.341 --> 16:10.011
You should have it at least once
if you live in Seoul.

16:11.554 --> 16:12.763
Guess I was wrong.

16:16.726 --> 16:18.769
What's with the sudden disappointment?

16:18.853 --> 16:19.770
Well?

16:19.854 --> 16:21.063
What were you expecting?

16:22.148 --> 16:24.650
Were you hoping to share
a different kind of ramyeon?

16:24.734 --> 16:26.402
What absolute nonsense!

16:28.779 --> 16:32.450
Dragging me to the Hangang River
for some damn ramyeon when I am exhausted?

16:32.533 --> 16:34.494
Come on, it's nice and cool here.

16:35.286 --> 16:36.412
Feel it for yourself.

16:42.251 --> 16:44.378
Now feel it for yourself.

16:44.462 --> 16:45.796
This cleansing chill.

16:59.727 --> 17:00.853
What is this?

17:04.273 --> 17:05.316
What's wrong?

17:06.484 --> 17:07.485
You don't like it?

17:08.736 --> 17:11.614
You like the ocean,
so I figured you'd like the river too.

17:15.076 --> 17:16.911
Why are you looking at me like that?

17:18.079 --> 17:20.373
Are you amazed by my face again?

17:25.002 --> 17:26.128
Damn fool.

17:26.837 --> 17:28.506
That is a bountiful load of crap.

17:36.055 --> 17:38.766
Mr. Cha's DUI scandal has died down
following Shin Seo-ri's explanation

17:38.849 --> 17:40.810
and the rumors of him
dating the Mochang heir.

17:40.893 --> 17:43.104
As a result, the declining stock price
has reversed course

17:43.187 --> 17:44.355
in after-hours trading.

17:45.064 --> 17:46.732
He's quite lucky with women.

17:46.816 --> 17:50.027
Two women swooped in
like knights in shining armor to save him.

17:50.111 --> 17:51.320
Hold on.

17:51.404 --> 17:52.989
What in the world…

17:54.240 --> 17:56.325
The very embodiment of public deception.

17:56.951 --> 17:58.494
What are you complaining about now?

17:58.578 --> 17:59.579
She is not Nongae.

17:59.662 --> 18:01.664
What could this besotted mermaid
possibly teach?

18:01.747 --> 18:03.624
She threw everything away for a man.

18:03.708 --> 18:05.543
She deserves no statue.

18:05.626 --> 18:06.877
Stripped to the waist, no less.

18:06.961 --> 18:08.004
Stripped?

18:09.714 --> 18:12.758
Are you ever going to let go
of this method-acting business?

18:13.676 --> 18:15.970
Do you think this is
some monument to feminine virtue?

18:16.053 --> 18:17.305
It's not for that.

18:17.930 --> 18:19.181
-It is not?
-No, it's not.

18:20.558 --> 18:22.059
Then what is it for?

18:22.143 --> 18:23.978
It's for making wishes.

18:24.061 --> 18:26.230
They say if you rub its nose
and make a wish,

18:26.314 --> 18:27.857
it comes true or something.

18:28.941 --> 18:30.693
What utter nonsense.

18:32.153 --> 18:33.946
Look. See how its nose is worn down.

18:34.030 --> 18:36.198
It's really like that
from all the people rubbing it.

18:36.282 --> 18:37.700
I will not fall for that!

18:37.783 --> 18:39.577
You're treating me like some fool.

18:40.661 --> 18:41.579
Give me a second.

18:42.204 --> 18:43.331
Yes, Mr. Son.

18:47.668 --> 18:50.004
Cha Se-gye has been a bit antsy.

18:51.172 --> 18:53.215
I feel like he has something to tell me.

18:54.383 --> 18:55.259
Any updates?

18:55.343 --> 18:57.637
Given how quickly
the press release went out,

18:57.720 --> 18:59.305
it appears it was prepared in advance.

18:59.388 --> 19:02.016
Ms. Mo has said she wishes
to discuss it with you in person.

19:02.099 --> 19:04.310
So Grandfather
and Mo Tae-hee teamed up?

19:04.393 --> 19:05.603
But what a relief.

19:05.686 --> 19:07.146
Instead of plummeting,

19:07.229 --> 19:09.231
our shares shot to 80,000 won
thanks to this.

19:09.315 --> 19:10.650
It went up that much?

19:13.944 --> 19:15.029
Noted, for now.

19:19.909 --> 19:22.328
How am I going to tell her this?

19:22.411 --> 19:24.497
With that temper, I'll be in for a fight.

19:25.956 --> 19:27.625
How dare you cheat on me?

19:28.209 --> 19:30.503
Do you truly wish to lose your head?

19:33.631 --> 19:35.841
Man, I'd be lucky if she just got mad.

19:38.928 --> 19:40.638
To think you were cheating on me.

19:41.263 --> 19:43.974
To think I am fated to be
some lowly concubine.

19:58.823 --> 20:01.075
I really don't want to see her cry.

20:06.956 --> 20:08.082
What? Are you crying?

20:13.003 --> 20:14.797
I pray to you.

20:14.880 --> 20:17.341
I pray to you, River God Habaek.

20:17.425 --> 20:19.051
I thought you didn't believe it.

20:26.308 --> 20:27.309
Keep it down!

20:31.355 --> 20:32.690
Done praying? Come here.

20:32.773 --> 20:34.650
No, I still have more to say.

20:34.734 --> 20:36.402
Shin Seo-ri, I've been thinking.

20:37.236 --> 20:39.530
Like you said,
we dodged a bullet more or less.

20:39.613 --> 20:42.491
Well, there was
some unintended collateral damage,

20:42.575 --> 20:44.452
but it seems we've mostly recovered.

20:45.995 --> 20:46.912
Anyway,

20:46.996 --> 20:48.831
you rushing over saved the day.

20:48.914 --> 20:50.416
After nagging me this whole time,

20:50.499 --> 20:51.542
now you say it?

20:53.461 --> 20:55.755
Your explanation earlier
was pretty smooth.

20:56.297 --> 20:58.048
You were super quick on your feet.

20:58.591 --> 20:59.842
What did you say again?

20:59.925 --> 21:02.636
A fine face and noble character?

21:02.720 --> 21:03.721
Your "beloved."

21:04.305 --> 21:05.598
Unbelievable.

21:06.098 --> 21:07.767
Do you find me that great?

21:07.850 --> 21:08.934
What are you saying?

21:12.480 --> 21:15.107
So, are you going to allow me
to become your beloved?

21:16.984 --> 21:18.527
Finally getting to the point?

21:21.280 --> 21:24.617
Fine. Since we both know
how we really feel anyway,

21:24.700 --> 21:26.118
why play hard to get?

21:26.702 --> 21:28.078
It only eats you up inside.

21:28.579 --> 21:29.580
I shall hereby

21:30.498 --> 21:31.957
grant you my permission.

21:33.334 --> 21:35.169
-You grant me permission?
-Yes, I do.

21:36.462 --> 21:38.839
I will grant you the chance
to seize this opportunity,

21:38.923 --> 21:42.218
so stop hesitating
like a sad little puppy in the rain.

21:43.052 --> 21:44.303
"Seize this opportunity"?

21:45.721 --> 21:46.847
Seize this…

21:50.142 --> 21:51.143
"See each other?"

21:52.144 --> 21:53.854
You want to see each other?

21:53.938 --> 21:56.106
From what I have gathered,
"seeing each other"

21:56.190 --> 21:58.275
is a kind of testing-the-waters period.

21:58.359 --> 21:59.735
Let us fan this flicker.

21:59.819 --> 22:02.071
Who knows? This flicker might one day

22:02.613 --> 22:04.114
become an exquisite flourish.

22:05.157 --> 22:07.117
At my age, with my credentials,

22:07.201 --> 22:08.828
must I really go through a trial period?

22:08.911 --> 22:10.287
So, do you not want to?

22:11.330 --> 22:13.457
No, that's not what I'm saying.

22:13.541 --> 22:17.878
Then again, in today's cutthroat world,
nobody would just hire someone full-time

22:17.962 --> 22:20.297
without a trial period first.

22:25.386 --> 22:27.388
Then I should tell you the truth too.

22:29.765 --> 22:32.101
Can't keep secrets
from the woman I'm seeing.

22:32.184 --> 22:33.936
Here it comes.

22:34.478 --> 22:35.688
I must remain composed.

22:37.606 --> 22:38.566
So…

22:39.066 --> 22:40.317
I completely understand.

22:42.570 --> 22:44.446
So you need not hold back any longer.

22:47.950 --> 22:49.034
You understand?

22:49.743 --> 22:50.703
Of course.

22:52.955 --> 22:56.208
Just one look in your eyes,
and I know everything you want to say.

22:59.336 --> 23:00.379
But still,

23:00.462 --> 23:03.883
with a completely sober mind,
my heart is not quite ready yet.

23:03.966 --> 23:06.468
Damn it. I guess I made it obvious.

23:09.680 --> 23:12.600
I was going to tell you
when I thought you could handle it.

23:14.184 --> 23:16.020
But since you understand, we're set.

23:17.104 --> 23:18.564
You see, in the world I'm from,

23:18.647 --> 23:21.400
even this is a sort of
business arrangement. That's all.

23:22.860 --> 23:25.321
But just in case,
let me make this clear now.

23:26.780 --> 23:28.324
I never asked for any of this.

23:28.908 --> 23:30.409
I was just suddenly handed a fiancée.

23:30.492 --> 23:31.744
I also have my grievances--

23:31.827 --> 23:32.828
What did you say?

23:33.746 --> 23:34.747
What fiancée?

23:38.709 --> 23:39.877
Damn it to hell.

23:39.960 --> 23:41.712
CHA SE-GYE AND MO TAE-HEE
CONFIRM RELATIONSHIP

23:42.338 --> 23:43.380
Rotten scoundrels…

23:47.801 --> 23:49.637
Hey, what are you doing?

23:49.720 --> 23:51.180
Is it not obvious? I'm planting seeds.

23:51.263 --> 23:52.932
Not even seedlings?
They'll take forever to grow.

23:53.015 --> 23:54.475
I am not trying to grow food.

23:54.558 --> 23:56.310
Just suppressing my urge to kill.

23:56.393 --> 23:59.188
If anyone crosses me right now,
heads will roll.

23:59.271 --> 24:01.398
That is why I must find solace in nature.

24:01.982 --> 24:03.692
You're not making any sense.

24:03.776 --> 24:04.860
Hold on.

24:05.402 --> 24:06.904
Those are nice photos.

24:06.987 --> 24:08.868
They look really good together,
don't they?

24:09.490 --> 24:10.699
Wow.

24:11.492 --> 24:13.494
-They certainly do not!
-What the--

24:13.577 --> 24:14.662
Are you nuts?

24:14.745 --> 24:17.331
They do look good together.
See for yourself.

24:17.414 --> 24:18.499
Damn it.

24:28.425 --> 24:29.426
Se-gye.

24:39.853 --> 24:41.230
Grandfather, let's go to the study.

24:41.313 --> 24:42.940
No, we can just talk here.

24:44.233 --> 24:46.735
Tae-hee will be
part of our family soon anyway.

24:46.819 --> 24:47.695
What's there to hide?

24:47.778 --> 24:50.030
Se-gye, don't worry about the controversy.

24:50.114 --> 24:53.617
Tae-hee, you should stop contacting
my grandfather behind my back.

24:53.701 --> 24:54.952
It makes us both look bad.

24:55.035 --> 24:56.453
Watch your mouth.

24:56.954 --> 24:58.330
I guess I was too hasty.

24:58.414 --> 25:00.791
I was worried you'd suffer
from false rumors,

25:00.874 --> 25:02.584
so I rushed things.

25:12.386 --> 25:13.971
What are you trying to do here?

25:15.097 --> 25:17.057
I just moved up the timeline

25:17.141 --> 25:18.183
for going public a bit.

25:18.267 --> 25:19.727
I didn't discuss it with you

25:19.810 --> 25:22.354
because I wanted to save you
from the other rumors quickly.

25:22.438 --> 25:23.647
That was my oversight.

25:23.731 --> 25:26.316
You seem to be suffering
from a serious misunderstanding.

25:26.400 --> 25:27.776
A strategic marriage to whitewash

25:27.860 --> 25:29.653
my half-breed chaebol image
doesn't interest me.

25:29.737 --> 25:31.697
-I no longer need to do that.
-Why not?

25:32.948 --> 25:34.283
Is it because of that woman,

25:34.366 --> 25:35.367
Shin Seo-ri?

25:39.913 --> 25:40.831
That's right.

25:40.914 --> 25:42.958
She's the only thing
I care about right now.

25:43.042 --> 25:45.002
So let's stop
with these sudden declarations of yours.

25:45.085 --> 25:46.962
Then why did you show up
for the blind date?

25:47.046 --> 25:49.381
It's rude to the woman
you're obsessed with

25:49.465 --> 25:50.883
and to me.

25:53.594 --> 25:54.595
I know.

25:55.262 --> 25:57.347
You two haven't been together that long.

25:57.431 --> 26:00.392
A relationship can heat up quickly
with the right spark,

26:00.476 --> 26:02.394
but it can cool down just as fast.

26:03.437 --> 26:04.730
I'll wait.

26:06.023 --> 26:07.149
As long as it takes.

26:08.942 --> 26:11.153
Seo-ri, you should be careful
around Mr. Cha.

26:11.236 --> 26:12.946
No good comes from a spokesperson

26:13.030 --> 26:15.699
appearing too close to the company CEO.

26:15.783 --> 26:17.910
It's the perfect setup for weird gossip.

26:17.993 --> 26:19.953
Are we in Joseon?
That is some archaic nonsense.

26:20.037 --> 26:21.789
You need to trust me on this, kid.

26:21.872 --> 26:23.874
A single scandal will sink
a nobody like you

26:23.957 --> 26:24.917
straight to the bottom.

26:25.000 --> 26:26.585
What was that? A nobody?

26:26.668 --> 26:27.711
-Why you…
-Oh, come on.

26:30.964 --> 26:33.634
And work on that damn temper of yours.

26:33.717 --> 26:36.887
If you go full prima donna
after landing one supporting role…

26:39.807 --> 26:42.434
Anyway, getting tangled up
with a taken man

26:42.518 --> 26:44.436
will leave your image beyond repair.

26:44.520 --> 26:47.439
So just be mindful of your conduct.

26:48.023 --> 26:50.275
Why are you so gloomy?
It doesn't suit you at all.

26:50.359 --> 26:53.195
A female friend is no match
for a real girlfriend anyway.

26:53.695 --> 26:54.947
Real girlfriend, my foot.

26:55.531 --> 26:57.157
Can you not tell just by looking?

26:57.241 --> 26:59.326
They are obviously just business partners.

26:59.409 --> 27:00.786
Just business partners?

27:01.411 --> 27:02.538
No wonder.

27:02.621 --> 27:04.998
I couldn't see any chemistry between them.

27:05.082 --> 27:06.041
Right?

27:06.125 --> 27:08.293
There is nothing going on between them.

27:08.377 --> 27:09.545
Wait a minute.

27:10.087 --> 27:12.214
That would make it a "contract" romance.

27:12.297 --> 27:14.133
That changes everything.

27:14.758 --> 27:16.802
-They're seeing this through.
-Through to where?

27:16.885 --> 27:19.096
Think about it.
What's the cardinal rule of K-romance?

27:19.179 --> 27:21.223
Contract romance,
contract marriage, contract divorce.

27:21.306 --> 27:24.768
Every contract between a man
and a woman eventually leads to love.

27:24.852 --> 27:26.603
Therefore, even when their contract ends,

27:26.687 --> 27:29.398
it's an unwritten rule
that they'll be bound forever.

27:29.481 --> 27:30.691
Baek Gwang-nam.

27:33.944 --> 27:36.321
Shall I bind your trap shut forever?

27:42.953 --> 27:44.079
Sir.

27:45.414 --> 27:47.875
Did Ms. Shin take it okay?

27:47.958 --> 27:50.043
With that temper of hers,
I doubt she just accepted it.

27:50.127 --> 27:52.004
She didn't even flinch.

27:52.087 --> 27:54.308
She said she couldn't care less
about a loveless fiancée.

27:55.299 --> 27:56.216
A fiancée.

27:56.300 --> 27:57.342
A fiancée?

27:57.426 --> 27:58.302
A fiancée.

27:58.385 --> 27:59.720
A fiancée…

28:01.013 --> 28:03.223
As if a loveless fiancée is some big deal.

28:03.307 --> 28:05.152
I could not care less.

28:06.101 --> 28:07.227
I'm completely unfazed.

28:07.311 --> 28:08.729
This is a serious problem.

28:08.812 --> 28:09.813
What is?

28:09.897 --> 28:12.608
She can't be that beautiful
and also be so understanding, right?

28:13.650 --> 28:14.610
Right?

28:17.029 --> 28:18.363
Gosh.

28:21.783 --> 28:23.202
Is he an idiot?

28:26.830 --> 28:27.831
Is it a gift?

28:27.915 --> 28:29.374
Yes, for my son.

28:29.958 --> 28:31.084
He likes baseball.

28:31.168 --> 28:32.377
Then,

28:32.461 --> 28:33.587
how about this one?

28:33.670 --> 28:34.713
It's cowhide,

28:34.796 --> 28:36.506
so the leather is soft enough for kids.

28:36.590 --> 28:38.800
No thanks. He won't be using it anyway.

28:40.302 --> 28:41.178
She has arrived.

28:41.261 --> 28:42.721
Please wrap this one up.

28:43.680 --> 28:45.390
-Adult size.
-Sure.

28:54.650 --> 28:56.151
I also thought long and hard

28:56.235 --> 28:59.404
about how much I stand to gain
from this potential union.

28:59.488 --> 29:02.616
Secure friendly shares to survive
the Chail Group power struggle to start.

29:02.699 --> 29:04.368
Rehabilitate my tarnished image as CEO.

29:04.451 --> 29:06.954
I realized the gains
were surprisingly substantial.

29:08.997 --> 29:10.707
Your path to the throne.

29:10.791 --> 29:13.126
I'm confident I could clear it for you.

29:13.877 --> 29:15.003
That's the problem.

29:15.629 --> 29:16.922
I'm not so confident

29:17.965 --> 29:20.092
I could give her up without regretting it.

29:20.801 --> 29:22.844
In other words,

29:22.928 --> 29:23.845
I've made my choice.

29:23.929 --> 29:25.013
Says who?

29:30.018 --> 29:31.812
It's been a while, Ms. Mo.

29:35.524 --> 29:37.734
-It has. Here for a meeting?
-Yes.

29:37.818 --> 29:39.861
-Have you been well?
-Oh right.

29:42.614 --> 29:43.657
I saw the article.

29:43.740 --> 29:46.326
When did things progress so far?
Truth be told,

29:46.410 --> 29:47.369
I was surprised.

29:47.452 --> 29:48.954
I told you.

29:49.037 --> 29:51.290
I fell for Se-gye at first sight.

29:53.083 --> 29:55.377
Must've been an impressive first meeting.

29:55.460 --> 29:57.796
Yes, it was impressive.

29:58.839 --> 30:01.174
He left quite an intense first impression.

30:01.258 --> 30:03.969
CHA SE-GYE, CEO OF BIOJEI
GRANDSON OF CHAIL GROUP CHAIRMAN

30:04.886 --> 30:07.014
Enough to make him unforgettable.

30:08.557 --> 30:09.766
It sounds a bit childish,

30:09.850 --> 30:13.020
but I wanted to leave one on him as well.

30:16.148 --> 30:17.316
Oh my God!

30:17.399 --> 30:19.318
Gosh. Oh no…

30:19.401 --> 30:20.986
I'm so sorry.

30:26.408 --> 30:27.784
Damn it.

30:27.868 --> 30:30.579
Oh my, I'm so sorry. Are you okay?

30:30.662 --> 30:33.123
That blind date is with me.

30:33.874 --> 30:35.917
Give me a chance to apologize properly.

30:37.586 --> 30:40.380
I thought that chance had finally come.

30:40.464 --> 30:41.548
CHA SE-GYE

30:41.631 --> 30:44.134
So you're just going
to continue ignoring my calls?

30:45.510 --> 30:46.845
Too bad.

30:46.928 --> 30:49.514
-This is just getting me more fired up.
-The number…

30:51.600 --> 30:54.269
Yes, Mr. Park. Release the file.

30:54.353 --> 30:55.395
Right now.

31:02.944 --> 31:06.073
You said marriage was the only way
to clean up a half-breed chaebol image.

31:06.156 --> 31:07.574
I see you chose strategic marriage.

31:07.657 --> 31:09.201
It's just business.

31:09.284 --> 31:10.577
I'll end it after this wraps up.

31:10.660 --> 31:13.121
Really? Why are you so blasé about it?

31:13.205 --> 31:15.874
Could it be because of that woman?

31:16.541 --> 31:17.459
What woman?

31:17.542 --> 31:18.460
You're dating.

31:19.086 --> 31:20.754
The one you said you care about.

31:20.837 --> 31:23.382
How do I know?
I'm an expert in this field.

31:23.465 --> 31:25.842
If I couldn't figure that out,
I'd have to quit.

31:26.802 --> 31:27.677
Right.

31:27.761 --> 31:30.514
Hey, since we're on the topic,
let me ask you something.

31:32.099 --> 31:34.393
She has some strange quirks.

31:34.476 --> 31:36.269
-As strange as you?
-Just listen.

31:37.062 --> 31:38.814
She can get a bit too intense sometimes.

31:38.897 --> 31:41.274
Always going on about life and death,
this lifetime, and whatnot.

31:41.358 --> 31:42.859
Needlessly dramatic.

31:42.943 --> 31:45.237
Like she's hung up
on some failed past life.

31:48.198 --> 31:50.117
Should she see a doctor?

31:50.200 --> 31:51.910
Well, that's great.

31:51.993 --> 31:54.371
You can bond over healing
in therapy like a happy couple.

31:54.454 --> 31:55.997
We're not a couple.

31:56.998 --> 31:59.209
"Happy couple"?

32:03.463 --> 32:04.756
Are you saying we're both insane?

32:04.840 --> 32:06.425
Damn it.

32:06.967 --> 32:09.386
I should charge double
for a compatibility reading.

32:09.469 --> 32:10.846
Darn it.

32:11.888 --> 32:13.640
Let's see here.

32:14.266 --> 32:16.601
The dragon-in-waiting meets
a typhoon in a drought

32:16.685 --> 32:18.812
and finally ascends.

32:18.895 --> 32:20.105
The clouds part

32:20.188 --> 32:22.399
and the sun rises.

32:22.482 --> 32:23.442
Gosh!

32:23.984 --> 32:25.402
The dragon-in-waiting ascended.

32:25.485 --> 32:27.195
Does that mean I will achieve my goal?

32:27.279 --> 32:30.407
If it ascends before becoming
a dragon, it's bound to fall.

32:31.241 --> 32:33.452
But the clouds parted, and the sun rose.

32:33.535 --> 32:34.619
A drought needs rain.

32:34.703 --> 32:36.580
If the sun rose, you're ruined.

32:36.663 --> 32:38.248
"DR." Doomed romance.

32:39.082 --> 32:40.167
Damn it.

32:41.585 --> 32:43.253
You do not know
what you are talking about.

32:43.336 --> 32:45.005
Sounds like you are making it up.

32:45.088 --> 32:46.840
No wonder you are stuck in this tent.

32:47.466 --> 32:49.509
Can you even afford rent on this place?

32:50.177 --> 32:51.553
I'd like to.

32:51.636 --> 32:54.514
I was once the 18th direct disciple
of the Celestial Maiden of Mount Jiri.

32:54.598 --> 32:55.974
I used to be hot stuff.

32:56.057 --> 32:58.977
I just blew the price of an apartment
on training fees for absolutely nothing.

32:59.060 --> 33:00.479
What? A whole apartment?

33:00.562 --> 33:01.646
Yes.

33:02.981 --> 33:03.857
Damn swindler…

33:04.524 --> 33:06.026
Where is it?

33:07.152 --> 33:08.528
You said Mount Jiri.

33:08.612 --> 33:10.238
She came down a while ago.

33:10.322 --> 33:12.532
These days, celestial maidens, generals,

33:12.616 --> 33:16.495
and all the mystics reside in Gangnam now.

33:16.578 --> 33:18.330
It has been a while.

33:21.583 --> 33:24.336
-What brings you here?
-Well, I…

33:26.963 --> 33:29.382
They say even a monk
cannot shave his own head.

33:29.466 --> 33:31.760
The Celestial Maiden of Mount Jiri
should know why I am here

33:31.843 --> 33:32.761
with just a glance, no?

33:34.846 --> 33:35.722
How dare you!

33:37.766 --> 33:40.060
So you want a compatibility reading.

33:41.603 --> 33:44.564
I pray to you, great spirit. I pray.

33:44.648 --> 33:46.274
Come now.

33:53.198 --> 33:54.199
My word.

33:55.075 --> 33:56.076
A cursed bond.

33:56.159 --> 33:57.410
Mortal enemies.

33:57.953 --> 34:01.248
So cosmically at odds,
they should never cross paths again.

34:05.627 --> 34:07.837
And yet, there may just be

34:07.921 --> 34:09.923
a way around it.

34:10.924 --> 34:12.634
What? With a talisman?

34:14.844 --> 34:17.138
How dare you try to swindle me as well!

34:17.847 --> 34:20.684
How dare you!
Are you calling me a swindler?

34:20.767 --> 34:22.852
Do you dare show
such irreverence in the presence

34:22.936 --> 34:24.145
of the Celestial Maiden?

34:24.229 --> 34:25.355
Do you?

34:30.902 --> 34:33.655
Have you been going around
saying I swindled you?

34:33.738 --> 34:36.074
Gosh. No, of course not.

34:36.157 --> 34:38.451
How could I do that to my great master?

34:38.535 --> 34:42.080
You said the training fees you paid
could buy a whole apartment.

34:42.163 --> 34:43.999
Well, actually, if we take

34:44.082 --> 34:45.917
inflation into consideration,

34:46.001 --> 34:48.295
-it'd be a high-rise--
-Yes, a high-rise!

34:48.837 --> 34:50.839
I have never seen
such a swindler in my life.

34:50.922 --> 34:52.007
Do as I say

34:52.090 --> 34:54.050
while I still ask nicely. Full refund.

34:54.134 --> 34:55.135
Full!

34:57.637 --> 34:58.638
Hey!

34:58.722 --> 35:00.682
Drag them out of here right now!

35:02.601 --> 35:03.727
Oh boy.

35:05.270 --> 35:07.272
Why, hello. Hey there.

35:07.355 --> 35:10.525
I highly recommend
just holding back if you can.

35:11.568 --> 35:12.861
Come on now.

35:12.944 --> 35:15.196
Just try laying a single finger on me.

35:16.281 --> 35:17.157
Why, I oughta!

35:17.824 --> 35:19.367
What are you standing around for?

35:19.451 --> 35:21.703
I told you to drag them out right now!

35:21.786 --> 35:23.413
Yeah, bring it on.

35:25.832 --> 35:28.835
I shall use your limbs
to fold you like a paper boat.

35:47.187 --> 35:48.563
What sort of training did they do?

35:48.647 --> 35:51.441
How does their martial prowess
surpass neighborhood thugs?

35:51.524 --> 35:53.276
They almost snapped my ankle off.

35:54.361 --> 35:56.404
You can't compare
undisciplined street thugs

35:56.488 --> 35:59.824
to devotees who trek barefoot
through Mount Jiri like them.

36:00.325 --> 36:01.201
Come on now.

36:01.284 --> 36:03.244
I don't even know
why you suddenly offered

36:03.328 --> 36:05.080
to get me a refund I never asked for.

36:05.163 --> 36:06.623
Ridiculous.

36:07.624 --> 36:08.958
Here, take one.

36:12.462 --> 36:14.005
To recharge.

36:16.174 --> 36:17.967
Wow, it's good.

36:18.051 --> 36:19.636
I feel a surge of energy.

36:21.221 --> 36:23.431
You feel reenergized? Gosh.

36:23.515 --> 36:24.516
Brazen wretches.

36:25.934 --> 36:27.686
I shall hone my martial prowess

36:27.769 --> 36:29.521
and secure that refund for you.

36:29.604 --> 36:31.147
I told you. I don't need no refund!

36:31.231 --> 36:33.650
Unbelievable.

36:37.320 --> 36:39.406
My goodness. Such a malevolent formation.

36:41.574 --> 36:43.243
Maybe it really is a cursed bond.

36:48.665 --> 36:50.291
Shin Seo-ri, what happened to your face?

36:50.375 --> 36:51.584
Did you get into a fight?

36:52.752 --> 36:55.463
There was no fight.
Just a one-sided beatdown.

36:55.547 --> 36:56.673
What have you been up to?

36:56.756 --> 36:58.425
-Hey, let me see that.
-Goodness.

36:58.508 --> 37:00.301
-Jeez, your cheek is…
-Goodness me, that aches.

37:00.385 --> 37:02.387
Did you actually go one-on-one?

37:06.057 --> 37:07.684
What are we going to do…

37:07.767 --> 37:09.602
I was wondering who had
the gall to seize

37:09.686 --> 37:10.895
the dressing room.

37:10.979 --> 37:13.273
Who knew it would be
just some random extras?

37:16.109 --> 37:17.736
I should head to my next scene.

37:20.196 --> 37:21.698
This is why

37:21.781 --> 37:24.325
people need to know their place.

37:24.409 --> 37:26.745
In this industry,
if you splash in waters too deep,

37:26.828 --> 37:29.080
you could be drowning
in sewage in an instant.

37:30.081 --> 37:32.876
As if someone like her
could ever seduce a chaebol.

37:37.130 --> 37:38.423
"Seduce"?

37:40.425 --> 37:41.509
What?

37:41.593 --> 37:43.720
"Jilted Actress A."

37:43.803 --> 37:45.054
Isn't that you?

37:45.138 --> 37:48.141
WASHED-UP CHILD STAR'S PIPE DREAM
SEDUCTION OF ENGAGED CHAEBOL FIZZLES

37:48.224 --> 37:49.434
WAS IT A CINDERELLA FANTASY?

37:51.686 --> 37:54.731
Mr. Son, did you find out
who first leaked this to the tabloids?

37:54.814 --> 37:57.025
Well, a reporter contact confirmed it was

37:57.108 --> 37:58.610
Mochang's External Relations Office.

37:58.693 --> 37:59.986
Mochang?

38:04.199 --> 38:05.241
I mean, sure,

38:05.325 --> 38:07.160
I get that you want to marry rich.

38:07.243 --> 38:08.119
Even so,

38:08.203 --> 38:10.371
you still should've picked
a league within your reach.

38:10.455 --> 38:11.581
Jilted…

38:11.664 --> 38:13.374
Seriously? That's so cringe.

38:13.458 --> 38:14.375
That's so tacky.

38:14.459 --> 38:16.169
I was planning to lead a quiet life,

38:16.252 --> 38:19.172
yet you keep flapping your gums
like you are untouchable.

38:19.255 --> 38:21.341
What? "Flapping my gums"?

38:23.009 --> 38:23.885
Listen, minx.

38:23.968 --> 38:26.930
Even if I splash too hard and end up
drowning in sewage like you said,

38:27.013 --> 38:28.139
I have nothing to lose.

38:28.223 --> 38:29.349
But I believe your situation

38:29.432 --> 38:30.558
is quite different.

38:30.642 --> 38:32.143
Am I wrong?

38:35.605 --> 38:36.815
Former Child Actor A.

38:36.898 --> 38:38.733
Known as the Queen of the Night.

38:38.817 --> 38:41.194
From her cosmetics ad
to her minor role in a historical drama,

38:41.277 --> 38:44.113
industry insiders say a shady deal
is behind her comeback.

38:44.197 --> 38:46.699
After failing to seduce a chaebol,
she now faces ruin.

38:46.783 --> 38:48.117
They ought to be deep-fried alive.

38:48.201 --> 38:49.744
How are they coming up with such lies?

38:52.372 --> 38:53.581
But are you sure "Actress A"

38:53.665 --> 38:55.124
is Shin Seo-ri?

38:55.208 --> 38:56.501
Yeah, I'm sure.

38:56.584 --> 38:59.170
I got the tip from the manager
of another actor at her agency.

38:59.254 --> 39:00.505
I'm 100% sure.

39:02.048 --> 39:03.591
Could that be Yoon Ji-hyo's manager?

39:03.675 --> 39:04.968
Yeah, how'd you know?

39:05.051 --> 39:06.302
-Mommy!
-Jesus!

39:06.386 --> 39:08.763
The scum of the earth!

39:08.847 --> 39:10.807
Sneaking around
like a little rat for a picture?

39:10.890 --> 39:12.308
Are you nuts?

39:12.392 --> 39:13.518
That is worth a fortune!

39:13.601 --> 39:16.145
You had no problem stealing my face
without knowing its worth.

39:16.229 --> 39:17.105
Steal?

39:17.188 --> 39:18.857
We do this because the public
has a right to know--

39:18.940 --> 39:20.483
The right to know? Really?

39:20.567 --> 39:22.360
Then I should expose
your mugs for all to see.

39:22.443 --> 39:25.488
Shall I have you doxxed
until you cannot leave your house?

39:25.572 --> 39:26.573
Why, you little…

39:27.907 --> 39:29.284
Hand over the phone!

39:34.873 --> 39:37.500
As I thought.
I have not lost my touch yet.

39:49.596 --> 39:51.514
Is crossing lines your hobby?

39:51.598 --> 39:53.016
You're basically asking for a fight.

39:53.099 --> 39:54.809
Se-gye, you like
"give and take," don't you?

39:54.893 --> 39:58.187
I believe our dating rumor saved
Biojei's stock from plummeting.

39:58.271 --> 40:01.149
With that in mind,
I'd like to make a proposal.

40:01.232 --> 40:03.776
So you gave,
and now you want to take?

40:03.860 --> 40:04.777
Let's hear it.

40:04.861 --> 40:06.988
Treat me properly as your fiancée.

40:07.071 --> 40:08.907
How about making me your partner

40:08.990 --> 40:10.825
for this weekend's launch party?

40:10.909 --> 40:12.785
Our first official photo op

40:12.869 --> 40:14.329
since the dating announcement.

40:14.412 --> 40:15.788
A couple shot?

40:15.872 --> 40:18.458
You want the partner spot
over the official brand ambassador.

40:18.541 --> 40:20.960
Yes. At this point, even for Ms. Shin,

40:21.044 --> 40:24.339
a public appearance together
would surely be too much for her.

40:24.422 --> 40:27.008
I'd be satisfied with just this for now.

40:27.550 --> 40:28.635
Not too hard, right?

40:32.722 --> 40:34.849
I was worried about that too,

40:35.475 --> 40:38.353
but you have suddenly provided
some clarity on the matter.

40:40.980 --> 40:41.898
CHIEF OF STAFF SON JAE-HAN

40:43.316 --> 40:44.317
Go ahead, Mr. Son.

40:44.400 --> 40:47.070
Sir, we have a big problem.
It's regarding Ms. Shin.

40:47.153 --> 40:48.279
What about Shin Seo-ri now?

40:48.363 --> 40:49.405
She just

40:50.031 --> 40:52.116
made a major score!

40:52.200 --> 40:55.328
Self-proclaimed Celestial Maiden
and cult leader Choi was arrested

40:55.411 --> 40:58.081
with her followers after a tip-off
from actress Shin Seo-ri.

40:58.164 --> 40:59.666
Police arrested Ms. Choi on the 7th

40:59.749 --> 41:02.126
on charges of repeatedly torturing
and assaulting followers

41:02.210 --> 41:04.921
under the claim that they were
possessed by evil spirits.

41:05.004 --> 41:06.923
Investigators also found she had embezzled

41:07.006 --> 41:09.258
large sums from followers
as "training fees"

41:09.342 --> 41:12.261
and evaded
roughly 1.5 billion won in taxes.

41:12.345 --> 41:13.888
When the police raided the shrine,

41:13.972 --> 41:16.724
they discovered her believers
were inhaling drugs during training,

41:16.808 --> 41:18.184
sending further shockwaves.

41:18.267 --> 41:20.436
Shin visited the shrine
to research for her current role,

41:20.520 --> 41:22.897
where she obtained evidence
of these activities

41:22.981 --> 41:24.816
and requested an investigation.

41:26.067 --> 41:27.110
Of course.

41:27.193 --> 41:29.529
Gosh, you even drink water
with such pizzazz.

41:29.612 --> 41:30.822
They were right.

41:30.905 --> 41:33.616
Muddy waters are best overturned
by a much larger wave.

41:33.700 --> 41:34.575
Hey, reporter lords.

41:34.659 --> 41:37.120
Instead of tailing a small fry like me,

41:37.203 --> 41:38.413
how about we negotiate?

41:38.496 --> 41:39.747
This scoop will easily pay off

41:39.831 --> 41:41.749
the cost of that camera.

41:41.833 --> 41:43.209
-A scoop?
-A scoop?

41:43.292 --> 41:44.168
Hey!

41:44.252 --> 41:45.503
Drag them both out this instant!

41:45.586 --> 41:46.462
Come on!

41:47.630 --> 41:48.756
Oh boy.

41:50.174 --> 41:51.384
Why, hello.

41:56.347 --> 41:57.890
Just look at this lot.

41:57.974 --> 41:59.517
Their eyes are all glazed over.

41:59.600 --> 42:00.727
I knew it.

42:00.810 --> 42:02.770
No amount of training barefoot

42:02.854 --> 42:05.023
can match the martial prowess
of those street thugs.

42:05.106 --> 42:08.901
Your Highness, how did you know
they were high on drugs?

42:09.777 --> 42:12.488
During my court maid days,
I met a physician who ruined his life

42:12.572 --> 42:14.407
after becoming addicted to poppies.

42:14.490 --> 42:15.992
By poppies, you mean…

42:16.075 --> 42:17.410
Opium.

42:17.952 --> 42:19.871
-Opium…
-It was a precious medicine

42:19.954 --> 42:21.080
used by the Royal Infirmary,

42:21.164 --> 42:22.874
but some fell under its spell

42:22.957 --> 42:24.917
and ruined their lives.

42:26.210 --> 42:28.087
The glazed eyes of those addicts

42:28.171 --> 42:29.422
looked exactly like theirs.

42:31.299 --> 42:33.301
Gosh, Your Highness.

42:33.384 --> 42:35.303
-Goodness.
-You're the best.

42:35.386 --> 42:37.055
That is right. Yes indeed.

42:37.138 --> 42:38.556
There's no one like you.

42:38.639 --> 42:39.891
That is right.

42:43.561 --> 42:45.104
Regarding this weekend,

42:45.188 --> 42:46.898
it'd be best to make separate plans.

42:46.981 --> 42:48.107
What?

42:48.191 --> 42:50.151
But earlier, you said you would--

42:50.234 --> 42:52.653
I said I found clarity.
I never said I'd go with you.

42:52.737 --> 42:54.072
You should always hear people out.

42:54.155 --> 42:56.949
I was just looking to shield her
from unnecessary drama.

42:57.033 --> 42:58.659
But after listening to you,

42:58.743 --> 43:00.787
I'm even more certain
about going with her.

43:00.870 --> 43:03.372
We did nothing wrong,
so there's no reason to hide.

43:03.456 --> 43:05.458
A friendly couple shot with Shin Seo-ri.

43:09.378 --> 43:12.340
You think one lousy article
is going to elevate that woman?

43:21.432 --> 43:22.558
Watch your mouth.

43:23.101 --> 43:25.353
I never intended to be
your partner in the first place.

43:25.436 --> 43:26.896
Quit coming after my woman

43:26.979 --> 43:28.481
with your petty little games.

43:30.233 --> 43:31.901
That's what I came to say.

43:31.984 --> 43:34.028
Let's make this our last meeting.

43:34.112 --> 43:37.198
Go through my office
until the broken engagement is announced.

43:40.284 --> 43:43.913
The actress who schooled a cult is
officially on her way to superstardom.

43:43.996 --> 43:47.500
Officially stanning Shin Seo-ri now.
Hoping her next project is action.

43:48.751 --> 43:50.545
Dumb luck served justice.
Two birds, one stone.

43:50.628 --> 43:52.380
At this point, she's destined for success.

43:52.463 --> 43:53.631
How dare they!

43:53.714 --> 43:55.258
"Dumb luck"?

43:55.800 --> 43:57.218
More like, "sharp instinct."

44:18.698 --> 44:19.615
Who are you?

44:24.036 --> 44:25.955
President Choi Mun-do sent me.

44:40.094 --> 44:41.971
He's waiting. Please come with me.

44:54.192 --> 44:55.484
Ms. Shin Seo-ri.

44:55.568 --> 44:57.904
I guess you're more understanding
than you let on.

44:57.987 --> 44:59.155
Enough to let

44:59.238 --> 45:01.324
Cha Se-gye get engaged to another woman?

45:01.407 --> 45:03.409
What are you scheming?
And what is that photo about?

45:03.492 --> 45:04.619
As I've said before,

45:04.702 --> 45:06.954
I'm giving you an opportunity here.

45:07.038 --> 45:09.415
A chance to save yourself
and your family.

45:10.124 --> 45:12.877
Break up Se-gye and Mochang.

45:13.461 --> 45:14.670
By whatever means necessary.

45:17.298 --> 45:20.218
A single photo of you two
leaving a hotel should do it.

45:21.010 --> 45:22.261
Are you telling me

45:22.803 --> 45:25.097
to manufacture a sordid scandal?

45:26.474 --> 45:27.850
Is that it?

45:28.851 --> 45:31.187
You have nothing to lose from this.

45:31.270 --> 45:33.731
But Cha Se-gye
must have lost his mind.

45:33.814 --> 45:35.191
To save you,

45:35.274 --> 45:37.568
he went ahead with an engagement
that wasn't even planned.

45:37.652 --> 45:38.736
Thanks to that,

45:38.819 --> 45:40.529
my position has become unstable.

45:44.158 --> 45:45.368
You have two weeks.

45:46.619 --> 45:47.703
Destruction deadline.

45:56.212 --> 45:58.714
As long as the Grand Prince
remains out of His favor,

45:58.798 --> 46:00.174
he will not survive.

46:00.967 --> 46:02.635
So make your choice.

46:02.718 --> 46:05.012
Die as the Grand Prince's beloved,

46:05.096 --> 46:07.932
or live as a witness to his treason.

46:16.899 --> 46:18.234
What brings you here…

46:25.199 --> 46:26.617
Dan-sim of the Kang clan.

46:26.701 --> 46:28.202
I knew you would turn out

46:28.286 --> 46:29.954
to be quite useful.

46:30.037 --> 46:33.457
To get close to my brother this quickly…

46:34.375 --> 46:35.501
I have not.

46:36.085 --> 46:37.628
How could someone like me--

46:38.671 --> 46:40.506
That is the proof.

46:41.299 --> 46:44.135
You likely took it
not knowing what it was.

46:44.218 --> 46:46.637
This was a gift from our older brother,

46:46.721 --> 46:48.139
the late Crown Prince,

46:48.222 --> 46:50.099
to his youngest brother.

46:51.559 --> 46:52.935
The late Crown Prince…

46:53.019 --> 46:53.894
Yes.

46:53.978 --> 46:57.273
A keepsake from my poor brother
who burned to death.

46:59.150 --> 47:01.152
And he gifted that keepsake to you?

47:01.694 --> 47:03.696
What do you think that means?

47:03.779 --> 47:05.239
That must mean

47:06.324 --> 47:07.950
you are somewhat special to him.

47:09.577 --> 47:11.037
Would you not agree?

47:28.971 --> 47:30.556
Even I would find it grievous

47:31.557 --> 47:33.642
to have my younger brother's neck snapped

47:33.726 --> 47:35.978
in the flower of his youth.

47:37.438 --> 47:39.065
So how about this?

47:40.024 --> 47:42.193
His honor will be tarnished,

47:42.985 --> 47:44.695
but his life will remain intact.

47:45.321 --> 47:47.740
Compared to plotting high treason…

47:49.742 --> 47:51.535
harassing a court lady

47:52.370 --> 47:53.871
is a much lighter offense, no?

47:55.456 --> 47:56.415
What does that…

47:59.001 --> 48:01.379
You have until early tomorrow afternoon.

48:44.672 --> 48:45.756
Of course I was terrified.

48:45.840 --> 48:48.259
Afraid you'd get dragged
through the mud with me.

48:49.135 --> 48:50.010
It scared me.

48:50.094 --> 48:52.805
You like the ocean,
so I figured you'd like the river too.

48:52.888 --> 48:53.973
Feel it for yourself.

48:54.056 --> 48:55.474
Now feel it for yourself.

48:56.308 --> 48:57.601
This cleansing chill.

49:11.407 --> 49:13.451
Why are you home so late,
Champion of Justice?

49:14.618 --> 49:16.745
Cha Se-gye, it appears

49:16.829 --> 49:19.665
I am fated to curse the men around me.

49:20.749 --> 49:22.334
Wherever I settle,

49:22.418 --> 49:24.378
desolation follows.

49:37.183 --> 49:38.851
What brings you here unannounced?

49:40.728 --> 49:43.439
We're seeing each other.
Surprises are allowed.

49:44.648 --> 49:47.151
How's my surprise visit?
Is your heart fluttering?

49:52.364 --> 49:53.365
You fool.

49:54.658 --> 49:56.160
Damn.

49:56.243 --> 49:59.038
They say love makes you a fool.

49:59.830 --> 50:02.917
I never knew what that meant,
but now I finally get it.

50:06.879 --> 50:08.923
Pull yourself together, Cha Se-gye.

50:09.673 --> 50:10.591
Neither of us

50:11.258 --> 50:13.552
has the time to get giddy
over playing house.

50:13.636 --> 50:14.720
No.

50:16.138 --> 50:17.097
I'm going to.

50:18.265 --> 50:19.934
That's exactly what I'll do.

50:20.017 --> 50:21.810
My whole life was black or white,

50:21.894 --> 50:23.270
ally or enemy.

50:23.354 --> 50:25.147
It was like living in a war zone.

50:25.231 --> 50:26.398
But you…

50:27.525 --> 50:29.109
You're my first real ally.

50:29.777 --> 50:32.655
Someone I could never
weigh the pros and cons of.

50:32.738 --> 50:34.031
You're the only one.

50:36.534 --> 50:37.952
-The only one?
-Yeah.

50:38.994 --> 50:40.746
You're the only one, Shin Seo-ri.

50:47.169 --> 50:48.295
So…

50:49.880 --> 50:52.716
when it's just us,
we can be a little immature.

50:56.136 --> 50:58.597
Screw this damn world,

50:59.181 --> 51:00.641
and let your heart flutter with me.

51:10.067 --> 51:11.485
Let me be your only one too.

51:33.132 --> 51:34.258
THE WOMEN'S KINGDOM SEASON 2

51:34.341 --> 51:36.677
EPISODE 7

51:37.761 --> 51:40.431
I clearly said once my illness
shows signs of recovery,

51:40.514 --> 51:42.766
I would pay my respects to the Queen.

51:42.850 --> 51:44.184
How dare you act so impertinently

51:44.268 --> 51:46.020
as if I were some criminal?

51:48.063 --> 51:49.607
It is the Queen's order.

51:49.690 --> 51:50.774
Please understand.

51:52.192 --> 51:54.778
Did you convey the state
of my illness correctly?

51:54.862 --> 51:56.697
You thought you could look down on me.

51:56.780 --> 51:58.365
Do you still see me as nothing more

51:58.449 --> 52:00.826
than some lowly court lady
who waits on you?

52:02.828 --> 52:04.538
Tell the Queen!

52:04.622 --> 52:06.165
That I will pay my respects

52:06.248 --> 52:08.000
once my condition improves.

52:08.083 --> 52:10.002
She's the real final boss.

52:10.085 --> 52:11.920
That's a solid wrist snap.

52:12.004 --> 52:13.172
I knew she'd do that.

52:13.255 --> 52:15.549
She has the face of a man-eater.
A nine-tailed fox.

52:15.633 --> 52:17.509
Has this old hag lost her mind?

52:17.593 --> 52:18.927
Who you calling a nine-tailed fox?

52:19.011 --> 52:20.971
Her eyes are slanted upwards.

52:21.055 --> 52:22.640
She totally looks like a fox.

52:22.723 --> 52:23.849
Shut your mouth.

52:23.932 --> 52:25.976
It takes one to know one.

52:26.060 --> 52:27.645
You want me to rip your eyes out?

52:27.728 --> 52:29.605
-Try it.
-Come here, you.

52:29.688 --> 52:30.689
-Crazy?
-Why you--

52:30.773 --> 52:31.690
Try it! Go on!

52:31.774 --> 52:33.233
That's enough talk. Come here now.

52:33.317 --> 52:34.318
-Stop it.
-Here I come!

52:34.401 --> 52:35.903
Come on. I'm waiting.

52:35.986 --> 52:37.613
-Please stop.
-Oh shush.

52:37.696 --> 52:42.451
SONGJIN GENERAL HOSPITAL

52:49.291 --> 52:51.126
Hey, why the long face again?

52:51.210 --> 52:53.045
Something bothering you again?

52:54.213 --> 52:55.964
Why did you not speak up earlier?

52:56.757 --> 52:57.966
That I am your grandkid.

52:59.301 --> 53:00.177
You saw that?

53:00.260 --> 53:02.721
By chance, are you embarrassed by me?

53:02.805 --> 53:04.348
Because it is embarrassing.

53:04.431 --> 53:05.516
Embarrassing?

53:05.599 --> 53:07.059
Of course it is.

53:11.397 --> 53:13.524
An old ghost like me acting up…

53:13.607 --> 53:15.275
What good would that do you?

53:17.861 --> 53:21.323
So stop coming down here
and just focus on your work.

53:21.407 --> 53:23.075
Strike while the iron is hot.

53:23.158 --> 53:26.245
If I want to see you,
I can just watch you on TV.

53:27.705 --> 53:28.956
Right?

53:35.254 --> 53:36.672
Seo-ri.

53:36.755 --> 53:37.798
You just focus on worrying

53:37.881 --> 53:39.174
about your own future.

53:39.883 --> 53:41.760
Turn a deaf ear to the nonsense,

53:41.844 --> 53:44.012
and just keep moving forward.

53:59.695 --> 54:01.405
Can I really do that?

54:02.322 --> 54:03.615
Will it be okay

54:04.742 --> 54:05.743
if I do that?

54:06.744 --> 54:07.995
You…

54:10.622 --> 54:13.751
more than deserve to be happy.

54:19.882 --> 54:21.675
Oh, my baby.

54:50.329 --> 54:52.289
Red was definitely the right choice.

54:58.128 --> 54:59.338
So pretty.

55:01.340 --> 55:02.758
Truly beautiful.

55:18.732 --> 55:19.733
I'll do it tomorrow.

55:34.373 --> 55:36.708
-What is the matter?
-In that well…

55:37.459 --> 55:38.752
In the well…

55:48.053 --> 55:49.263
My goodness!

55:49.972 --> 55:52.057
You are hereby placed under arrest.

55:52.140 --> 55:53.684
What harassment?

55:54.309 --> 55:55.936
That is completely absurd.

55:56.019 --> 55:58.313
How could Father believe
such a sordid rumor?

56:05.445 --> 56:07.030
Dan-sim of the Kang clan?

56:08.282 --> 56:10.284
If you wish to save that girl,

56:10.367 --> 56:11.952
submit peacefully.

56:24.923 --> 56:26.967
Geum-ok was my colleague.

56:27.926 --> 56:30.345
A few days ago,
I realized she was with child.

56:30.971 --> 56:33.557
Last night,
I asked again who fathered the child.

56:35.517 --> 56:37.686
She named Grand Prince Cheongheon

56:37.769 --> 56:39.730
before doing this…

56:39.813 --> 56:41.481
While on night watch,

56:41.565 --> 56:44.109
I saw that girl sneaking
into Grand Prince Cheongheon's quarters

56:44.192 --> 56:45.527
with my own two eyes.

56:50.616 --> 56:53.702
Proof of your scandal
runs so deep it spills over.

56:53.785 --> 56:56.121
Do you still refuse to admit your crimes?

56:56.955 --> 56:58.582
Is she safe?

56:58.665 --> 57:00.834
It all hangs
on what comes out of your mouth.

57:00.918 --> 57:02.336
How will you proceed?

57:02.419 --> 57:04.463
If you will make me a binding promise…

57:08.091 --> 57:10.677
I shall do as Your Highness wishes.

57:13.180 --> 57:14.973
You wish to strike a deal?

57:16.099 --> 57:19.186
It appears you have yet to grasp
the gravity of the situation.

57:20.187 --> 57:21.271
Bring her in.

57:48.382 --> 57:49.383
I…

57:50.968 --> 57:52.886
wish to tell the truth.

57:53.428 --> 57:55.013
Shortly after

57:55.097 --> 57:57.849
I was assigned to his quarters…

57:59.726 --> 58:01.228
His Highness

58:01.311 --> 58:03.188
tried to force himself on me as well.

58:07.943 --> 58:09.903
This is the evidence.

58:11.905 --> 58:13.031
You…

58:13.115 --> 58:14.324
Evidence?

58:27.087 --> 58:28.171
Why, this is…

58:32.175 --> 58:35.178
My brother, the Crown Prince,
gifted this to him.

58:35.262 --> 58:37.264
How is this in your possession?

58:38.765 --> 58:40.767
His Highness told me to keep it

58:42.227 --> 58:43.937
as a token of affection.

58:45.105 --> 58:48.275
I was beyond shocked and bewildered…

58:52.029 --> 58:54.614
that I begged him to rescind it.

58:54.698 --> 58:55.741
Enough.

59:08.378 --> 59:10.964
But he insisted so heavily…

59:11.048 --> 59:12.174
That is enough.

59:16.595 --> 59:17.763
It is true.

59:20.432 --> 59:23.393
I engaged in illicit relations
with the court ladies.

59:23.477 --> 59:24.394
Therefore,

59:24.936 --> 59:26.938
I ask you to spare this court lady

59:27.022 --> 59:29.274
and punish me as you see fit.

01:00:09.356 --> 01:00:11.900
Even if I stand at the crossroads
of life and death again,

01:00:11.983 --> 01:00:15.028
I will never cower behind a man.

01:00:15.112 --> 01:00:16.154
I…

01:00:17.572 --> 01:00:19.241
wish to tell the truth.

01:00:20.408 --> 01:00:22.911
I am truly glad to be alive.

01:00:22.994 --> 01:00:24.955
What, are you back from the dead?

01:00:25.038 --> 01:00:27.165
I am so happy to be alive.

01:00:27.249 --> 01:00:29.084
What is your name?

01:00:32.379 --> 01:00:35.298
Of course, my name is…

01:00:50.689 --> 01:00:53.358
You told me
to bring everything, so I did,

01:00:53.441 --> 01:00:54.609
but what is all this?

01:00:54.693 --> 01:00:58.280
Designers are begging me
to wear their clothes. How could I refuse?

01:00:58.363 --> 01:00:59.531
Champion of Justice…

01:01:00.657 --> 01:01:02.826
Wait. Does this look better?

01:01:02.909 --> 01:01:05.078
Why are you changing again?

01:01:05.996 --> 01:01:08.373
I have snagged
every last bit of luxury today.

01:01:08.456 --> 01:01:09.708
I am the main character today.

01:01:16.089 --> 01:01:18.884
Ms. Shin, you should leave now.

01:01:18.967 --> 01:01:20.135
Says who?

01:01:20.218 --> 01:01:21.553
I am the main character today.

01:01:22.262 --> 01:01:23.722
You appear to be an uninvited guest.

01:01:23.805 --> 01:01:26.308
Looks like you had some fun
with that flash of good press,

01:01:26.391 --> 01:01:28.018
but that's as far as you'll go.

01:01:28.101 --> 01:01:31.313
I am far more suited to stand by his side
than someone whose reputation

01:01:31.396 --> 01:01:34.357
can be made or broken
by a single tabloid rumor, no?

01:01:35.901 --> 01:01:37.485
It was you.

01:01:37.569 --> 01:01:39.686
You are the instigator of my scandal.

01:01:39.761 --> 01:01:41.114
That's right.

01:01:41.198 --> 01:01:43.658
You were starting
to get on my nerves, you see.

01:01:43.742 --> 01:01:46.411
So I'd like for you to get lost now.

01:01:46.494 --> 01:01:48.413
Get lost? What am I, a puppy?

01:01:49.289 --> 01:01:50.165
Listen closely.

01:01:50.248 --> 01:01:51.917
I live for today.

01:01:53.960 --> 01:01:56.671
I have to strike while the iron is hot
and push forward.

01:01:56.755 --> 01:01:58.590
So spare me the rest of your drivel,

01:01:59.424 --> 01:02:01.176
and quietly get lost yourself.

01:02:06.306 --> 01:02:08.767
Sounds like you're not afraid of anything.

01:02:08.850 --> 01:02:09.935
Then how about this?

01:02:10.018 --> 01:02:12.812
"The unfilial granddaughter who abandoned
her only flesh and blood,

01:02:12.896 --> 01:02:14.105
her grandmother with dementia."

01:02:14.189 --> 01:02:15.440
Or this one might work too.

01:02:16.233 --> 01:02:19.361
"The parasitic grandmother
who bled her actress granddaughter dry."

01:02:19.444 --> 01:02:20.654
"Debt scandal."

01:02:21.363 --> 01:02:22.322
Do you

01:02:23.490 --> 01:02:24.616
have a death wish?

01:02:28.620 --> 01:02:30.538
Finally hit a nerve, did I?

01:02:31.331 --> 01:02:32.707
I guess you cherish your family?

01:02:33.750 --> 01:02:35.710
Then go take care
of your sick grandmother.

01:02:35.794 --> 01:02:39.047
Stop forgetting your place,
trying to steal another woman's man.

01:02:40.048 --> 01:02:42.133
Who says he is your man?

01:02:42.217 --> 01:02:43.760
From what I hear,

01:02:43.843 --> 01:02:45.929
you have been conspiring
from the shadows.

01:02:46.972 --> 01:02:48.598
Let me give you some advice.

01:02:49.140 --> 01:02:50.725
If you want to win a man's heart,

01:02:50.809 --> 01:02:52.560
you should stop acting

01:02:52.644 --> 01:02:55.313
like an anxious dog, whining at the door.

01:02:55.397 --> 01:02:57.065
You would scare away any man like that.

01:02:57.148 --> 01:02:58.358
What?

01:02:58.900 --> 01:03:00.568
Why, you crazy bitch.

01:03:11.329 --> 01:03:12.205
Se-gye.

01:03:13.123 --> 01:03:13.999
You…

01:03:15.250 --> 01:03:17.002
Shin Seo-ri, we need to talk.

01:03:36.646 --> 01:03:38.106
Did you summon her?

01:03:39.149 --> 01:03:41.818
I would have prepared myself
if I had known earlier.

01:03:43.403 --> 01:03:44.738
She barged in so suddenly.

01:03:45.280 --> 01:03:47.574
I almost grabbed her by the hair.

01:03:47.657 --> 01:03:50.076
If we were caught on camera,
we would be in quite a bind.

01:03:50.160 --> 01:03:51.453
I almost got canceled.

01:03:54.497 --> 01:03:55.707
What is it?

01:03:55.790 --> 01:03:56.958
Why are you staring?

01:04:00.837 --> 01:04:02.797
Well, too bad if you are disappointed.

01:04:02.881 --> 01:04:05.091
You cannot take back seeing each other.

01:04:05.175 --> 01:04:07.302
You know my temper well enough.

01:04:08.511 --> 01:04:10.055
There is no point in regretting it now.

01:04:10.138 --> 01:04:11.181
Who are you?

01:04:13.308 --> 01:04:14.559
You…

01:04:17.395 --> 01:04:18.563
What do you mean, who?

01:04:20.315 --> 01:04:21.900
Are you still half-asleep?

01:04:23.151 --> 01:04:24.486
You cannot come dressed like this.

01:04:24.569 --> 01:04:25.612
You should change first--

01:04:25.695 --> 01:04:26.696
Dan-sim.

01:04:32.243 --> 01:04:33.119
Kang.

01:04:35.205 --> 01:04:36.373
Dan-sim.

01:04:40.460 --> 01:04:42.045
What did you just…

01:04:42.128 --> 01:04:43.296
Dan-sim of the Kang clan.

01:04:44.923 --> 01:04:46.132
Who are you?

01:04:48.718 --> 01:04:49.969
How…

01:04:56.935 --> 01:04:58.686
Who are you really?

01:05:04.567 --> 01:05:06.403
Why do you stare at it so intently?

01:05:06.486 --> 01:05:09.948
Does a plum blossom flowering
in midsummer unsettle you so?

01:05:10.031 --> 01:05:12.700
Yes, it is quite an unsettling sight.

01:05:14.369 --> 01:05:16.579
I gaze upon the flower
blooming out of season

01:05:17.288 --> 01:05:18.498
because it is unsettling

01:05:19.624 --> 01:05:21.084
and pitiable.

01:05:50.029 --> 01:05:53.324
MY ROYAL NEMESIS

01:06:24.045 --> 01:06:25.045
-Shin Seo-ri.
-Gosh!

01:06:25.154 --> 01:06:27.066
Grandfather, I need
to introduce you to someone.

01:06:27.150 --> 01:06:28.943
Nice to meet you, Grandpapa!

01:06:29.027 --> 01:06:30.320
The Women's Kingdom?

01:06:30.403 --> 01:06:31.321
"Consummation"?

01:06:31.404 --> 01:06:32.530
Your Majesty!

01:06:33.156 --> 01:06:34.782
This is bull…

01:06:34.866 --> 01:06:37.494
-What was it replaced with?
-The Sericulture Rite scene.

01:06:37.577 --> 01:06:39.913
Thanks to you, I totally stole that scene.

01:06:39.996 --> 01:06:40.997
Sickeningly sweet.

01:06:41.080 --> 01:06:42.707
How could they lose a patient?

01:06:42.790 --> 01:06:45.126
She must be kept
from making any outside contact.

01:06:45.210 --> 01:06:46.753
A woman keeps appearing in my dreams.

01:06:46.836 --> 01:06:48.129
It seemed like that man

01:06:48.213 --> 01:06:51.299
felt a deep yearning
for that woman named Kang Dan-sim.

01:06:51.382 --> 01:06:52.592
What if it were not a dream?

01:06:52.675 --> 01:06:56.095
If I were that woman, Kang Dan-sim,
what would you do?

01:06:57.933 --> 01:06:59.933
Subtitle translation by Justin S. Kim
